// Cross-border reporting (ARCHITECTURE.md 12). Every foreign-currency credit a customer receives is reported to the
// South African Reserve Bank's financial surveillance department through the authorised dealer, with the reason for
// the payment (its balance-of-payments category). The customer gives the reason; Forge records it with the credit.
// The submission format is not verified (VERIFY-FINSURV), so nothing is submitted: each record is kept as evidence
// until the format and the authorised dealer's channel are confirmed.

